id=rackphone-telemetry
name=Rackphone Telemetry
version=v0.3.0
versionCode=3
author=nktkln
description=Prometheus exporter for a phone acting as a server unit. Collects battery, thermal, CPU, memory, storage, network and radio metrics on-device; the Proxmox host bridges them over adb so nothing is exposed to the network.
